WEBVTT

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:16.200
Go, go, Angels!

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:17.490
Let's go, Angels!

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:19.160
Go, fight, win!

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:22.080
Go, go, Angels!

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:23.580
Let's go, Angels!

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:25.010
Go, fight, win!

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:38.850
Let's go!

00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:20.990
Let's go!

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:51.840
<i>The sight that I, Hatoya Kohane,</i>

00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:54.510
<i>saw that day...</i>

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:55.580
<i>changed my whole world!</i>

00:01:56.330 --> 00:01:57.970
Uki!

00:01:58.220 --> 00:01:59.910
K-Kohane?

00:02:00.970 --> 00:02:03.510
I found something that I want to do!

00:02:03.510 --> 00:02:04.640
And it's called...

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:05.720
chair!

00:02:06.470 --> 00:02:07.480
<i>Chair?</i>

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:12.360
<b>Episode 1: My First Time Cheerleading</b>

00:02:09.620 --> 00:02:12.360
Oh, cheer. You mean cheerleading.

00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:15.140
Yeah! That's exactly what I said!

00:02:15.140 --> 00:02:16.570
Uh, no, it's not.

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:18.180
Isn't it cool?

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:21.290
There's a whole sport made to cheer on

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:22.700
and support others!

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:25.580
Everyone was so in sync!

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:28.580
They were cute and cool!

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:33.390
They did this, and that, and this...

00:02:30.730 --> 00:02:33.390
Wait, are we talking about the Bon dance?

00:02:33.390 --> 00:02:34.420
No, chair!

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:36.620
Oh, I get it! I need to yell something!

00:02:36.620 --> 00:02:38.970
That's what I'm missing!

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:42.730
Spin-ach leaves!

00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:45.410
Spin-ach leaves!

00:02:43.110 --> 00:02:45.020
If you wanna look like a 
working-class newbie doing

00:02:45.020 --> 00:02:46.850
the Bon dance for the first time, you've got it.

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:50.920
But the more I think about it,
 I think that cheer is perfect for you.

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:52.810
You'd be supporting other people.

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:57.480
Hatoya Kohane

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:57.480
15 years old

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:56.800
You always put others before yourself.

00:02:57.650 --> 00:03:00.430
<i>Chair is perfect for me... me... me...</i>

00:03:00.430 --> 00:03:01.820
And she's not listening.

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:06.310
Well, if you're gonna start, it'll probably be
 in April when we start high school...

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:08.620
Sawatari Uki

00:03:06.310 --> 00:03:08.620
They might even have a cheer club.

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:08.620
15 years old

00:03:08.810 --> 00:03:12.320
A chair club?! What's that?! 
That sounds amazing!

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:15.150
Right, let's work on you saying 
"cheer" correctly first.

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:17.800
Sawatari Uki

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:17.800
15 years old

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:17.800
Can't hold back the snark

00:03:18.450 --> 00:03:20.740
<i>Ever since then, Kohane...</i>

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:25.730
In two more weeks,
 I'll be in the chair club!

00:03:25.730 --> 00:03:27.550
I can't wait!

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:31.810
I just want it to be April already!

00:03:32.070 --> 00:03:33.810
Sensei!

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:36.320
I want to join the chair club!

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:37.710
Chair club?

00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:40.190
Oh, you mean a cheerleading club.

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:41.540
We don't have one.

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:45.490
May the next three years 
in this place of learning

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:49.300
help sustain you for the rest of your life.

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:53.790
That is our staff's heartfelt wish.

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:55.400
<i>This is probably my fault. I got her all riled up.</i>

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:58.260
Cheer up, Kohane.

00:03:56.430 --> 00:04:00.710
Next, a word from the new students' 
representative, Arima Hizume-san.

00:03:58.260 --> 00:03:59.250
Yeah...

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:02.130
Yes.

00:04:05.310 --> 00:04:06.370
<i>Huh?</i>

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:10.980
This spring, we have taken our 
first step down this new path

00:04:08.110 --> 00:04:10.500
<i>I'm pretty sure I've seen her before...</i>

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:12.920
as first years at Kaminoki High School.

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:14.450
Quiet down over there!

00:04:14.450 --> 00:04:15.730
You got over that way too fast!

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:17.480
I've made up my mind!

00:04:17.740 --> 00:04:19.310
I'm going to make a chair club!

00:04:19.310 --> 00:04:20.480
Right...

00:04:20.790 --> 00:04:23.190
If it doesn't exist, I just 
have to make one!

00:04:23.190 --> 00:04:24.960
Now we have a veteran at our school, too!

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:26.740
Veteran?

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:31.120
Oh, the new student rep is a cheerleader?

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:34.630
I'm surprised you remembered. 
Talk about coincidence.

00:04:34.630 --> 00:04:36.500
This is basically fate!

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:38.840
I mean... She was super pretty!

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:40.880
Both her dance moves and smile

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.710
were totally sparkling!

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:46.380
Don't worry, Uki. You're pretty, too!

00:04:46.380 --> 00:04:47.720
Wh-What are you talking about?!

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:49.810
Your snark and your embarrassed face

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:51.700
are both sparkling!

00:04:51.700 --> 00:04:53.680
Not a compliment!

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:56.670
But I'm actually relieved

00:04:56.670 --> 00:05:00.440
that you found something 
you're passionate about.

00:05:01.050 --> 00:05:04.330
All you ever do is help other people.

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:07.650
It was like you didn't have 
anything you wanted to do...

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:10.750
Y-You see...

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:13.910
I was pretty worried... huh?

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:18.750
Screech!

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:21.750
<b>Faculty Room</b>

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:21.750
Sensei, I'm going to make a chair club!

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:25.280
You need at least five 
members to start a club.

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:28.510
Uki, we need to find members!

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:29.980
Just three more!

00:05:29.980 --> 00:05:31.640
I'm not joining.

00:05:33.110 --> 00:05:35.860
What? Why? It'll be fun!

00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:37.560
The uniform's cute, too!

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:40.650
Don't make me wear that in your head! 
I can't wear something like that!

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:43.940
But you like cute things, Uki! 
Even though you hide it.

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:44.780
Hey!

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:48.340
Anytime there are idols on TV, 
you suddenly get quiet and watch!

00:05:48.340 --> 00:05:51.170
Your eyes always wander 
towards cute outfits!

00:05:51.170 --> 00:05:52.190
Really?

00:05:52.190 --> 00:05:53.700
I never knew...

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:56.960
Kohane...

00:05:55.720 --> 00:05:58.710
Uki? Your eyes look scary...

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:03.210
Kohane!

00:06:10.020 --> 00:06:11.320
Are you all right?

00:06:13.380 --> 00:06:13.970
Thank you!

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:21.900
You're the chair person!

00:06:22.550 --> 00:06:24.900
No, I'm afraid I'm not a chair...

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:27.600
I'm so sorry, Kohane!
 Thank goodness you're okay!

00:06:27.600 --> 00:06:28.900
Oh, wait!

00:06:30.180 --> 00:06:32.360
Thanks for saving me!

00:06:32.360 --> 00:06:37.050
It's no problem. You're light as
 a feather, so it was fine.

00:06:37.050 --> 00:06:38.910
You must be strong!

00:06:39.380 --> 00:06:41.210
Yes, I guess...

00:06:43.280 --> 00:06:46.140
So, hey, you're Arima-san, right?

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:48.800
Arima Hizume

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:48.800
Have we met before?

00:06:49.060 --> 00:06:53.620
Yeah! I just happened to see you doing 
chair a while back by the river.

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:54.490
I'm sorry, but...

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:57.680
Totally serious (probably)

00:06:55.730 --> 00:06:57.670
I'm quite certain that 
I've never been a chair.

00:06:57.670 --> 00:07:00.310
I know you can figure it out! 
She means cheer, not chair.

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:01.860
Say, Arima-san...

00:07:01.860 --> 00:07:02.520
Let's do chair—

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:03.630
It's cheer.

00:07:03.630 --> 00:07:05.330
Cheer together! I'm trying to—

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:06.320
I won't.

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:16.170
Cheer is already in my past.

00:07:17.590 --> 00:07:20.340
<i>Cheer is already in my past.</i>

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:22.330
Cheer is already in my past

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:24.130
Cheer is absolutely the best?

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:25.710
Cheer is absolutely the best

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:25.710
That's reaching too far!

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:31.130
<i>To think that someone here 
knew I used to do cheer...</i>

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:32.350
<i>That was a bit surprising.</i>

00:07:33.560 --> 00:07:37.270
<i>No one would usually think...</i>

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:35.890
Just a little more...

00:07:38.370 --> 00:07:39.580
Down, and up!

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:43.450
<i>...that I'm a cheerleader on my free time.</i>

00:07:42.130 --> 00:07:44.300
Uh, thanks?

00:07:48.930 --> 00:07:50.410
I finally found her...

00:07:51.420 --> 00:07:53.420
Everyone rejected me!

00:07:53.420 --> 00:07:57.080
I-I just can't be a cheerleader! 
I didn't actually reject you!

00:07:58.220 --> 00:07:59.330
<i>But...</i>

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:02.440
<i>She looked so painful when I asked her...</i>

00:08:06.330 --> 00:08:08.810
Looks like I got cheerleader number one!

00:08:08.810 --> 00:08:10.090
What? Where?

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:17.100
Self-Introductions

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:17.100
U-Um...

00:08:17.290 --> 00:08:21.080
I'm Tatejima... Kotetsu.

00:08:21.590 --> 00:08:23.870
My favorite subject is music.

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:25.510
My least favorite is P.E.

00:08:25.510 --> 00:08:29.520
Self-introductions! This might be the perfect
 opportunity to promote cheer club!

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:31.940
Okay, next.

00:08:32.100 --> 00:08:32.700
Okay!

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:35.990
I'm Hatoya Kohane! I'm going 
to make a cheerleading club!

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:38.200
What the heck? That's so cool.

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:39.860
Cheer seems fun.

00:08:39.860 --> 00:08:41.200
Okay, next.

00:08:41.390 --> 00:08:42.080
Okay!

00:08:42.270 --> 00:08:44.030
I'm Hatoya Kohane!

00:08:44.030 --> 00:08:45.010
What?

00:08:45.010 --> 00:08:45.930
I'm in the cheer club!

00:08:45.930 --> 00:08:47.290
<i>That's not the way to do it!</i>

00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:49.750
Are you going to see that girl again?

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:51.460
Yeah! I'm gonna make my hundred visits!

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:53.300
That saying's usually for shrines...

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:55.450
Oh, Arima-san!

00:08:58.040 --> 00:08:59.990
Maybe she's avoiding you.

00:08:59.990 --> 00:09:02.020
What? Why?!

00:09:02.370 --> 00:09:05.330
She's probably on her guard since 
she doesn't know you very well.

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:06.810
In that case...

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:11.320
My name is Hatoya Kohane!!
 15 years old   Birthday: July 4th

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:10.220
I need her to get to know me first!

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:16.570
Family: I live with my Dad, Mom, and Grandma!

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:18.240
She posted it?!

00:09:18.890 --> 00:09:21.830
It wasn't mine, so I thought
 it was a mistake.

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:22.800
Here you go.

00:09:22.800 --> 00:09:26.570
No! First, I wanted you to get to know me!

00:09:26.570 --> 00:09:27.580
Here!

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:31.540
Hatoya Kohane. 15 years old.

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:33.610
Your three sizes from the top...

00:09:34.530 --> 00:09:36.090
What the heck did you write?!

00:09:36.770 --> 00:09:40.450
Kohane's three sizes almost got 
posted for the whole world to see!

00:09:41.160 --> 00:09:43.080
What did you mean by "first"?

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:47.100
Well, of course... I'm eventually going 
to invite you into the cheer club!

00:09:47.490 --> 00:09:50.270
I'm pretty sure I told you that 
cheer is already in my past.

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:57.990
Favorite Phrase
 Never give up!

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:57.990
Hobbies: Picking up 
garbage and cooking!

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:57.990
Let's do cheer together!!

00:09:54.890 --> 00:09:56.660
<i>She seems persistent.</i>

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:03.490
Break

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:03.490
Arima-san, great work today!

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:03.490
Hizume's seat

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:05.620
Lunch break

00:10:03.890 --> 00:10:05.620
Arima-san, let's have lunch together!

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:08.870
After school

00:10:06.220 --> 00:10:08.870
Arima-san, let's go home toge—Huh?

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:10.060
She's not here.

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:13.670
Please do something about her!
 You're her guardian!

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:16.510
Well, she doesn't exactly listen, so...

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:18.430
Oh, there you are, Arima-san!

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:20.890
So you've found me...

00:10:23.320 --> 00:10:24.470
What's the matter?

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:26.310
Huh? N-Nothing...

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:28.310
It's nothing...

00:10:28.990 --> 00:10:33.320
Although I might be a tiny 
bit scared of heights...

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:34.850
or something.

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:36.610
Heights?

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:38.620
This is only the second floor, though.

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:43.590
This is pretty much my limit, to be honest.

00:10:43.590 --> 00:10:46.250
And yet you want to be a cheerleader...

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:46.250
*Please do not stand on your desk

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:50.240
Not only does cheerleading have 
group techniques called "stunts,"

00:10:50.590 --> 00:10:53.870
but that also includes being 
thrown high into the air.

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:56.990
High... into the air...

00:10:56.990 --> 00:10:59.010
She's acting like she heard a scary story!

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:03.300
Are there any stunts for people 
who are scared of heights?

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:04.950
I can't say I've heard of any.

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:08.240
I've got plans, so I'm gonna get going.

00:11:08.240 --> 00:11:08.890
Huh?

00:11:09.160 --> 00:11:11.280
Do your best. See ya.

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:16.020
Hey, Arima-san!

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:17.900
Please stop following me!

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:21.490
No matter how many times you ask, 
I'm not cheerleading any—

00:11:21.750 --> 00:11:24.000
Sorry about this...

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:27.800
You're so...

00:11:29.690 --> 00:11:33.160
nice, if you quit following people
 around like a pervert would...

00:11:33.160 --> 00:11:34.770
Like a pervert?

00:11:34.770 --> 00:11:38.010
Are you a pervert, little girl?

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:43.890
Why do you want to do 
cheer with me so much?

00:11:44.110 --> 00:11:48.010
What? You wanna hear how
 I fell in love with cheerleading?

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:53.600
You see... I love helping others out.

00:11:53.840 --> 00:11:57.380
Because of that, I always 
put others before me.

00:11:57.790 --> 00:12:00.200
And then, Uki got worried 
about me and said...

00:12:00.200 --> 00:12:03.160
<i>Why don't you do something for 
yourself sometime, Kohane?</i>

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:06.490
<i>I'd always get stuck in high places,</i>

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:08.260
<i>or get myself all bruised,</i>

00:12:08.260 --> 00:12:10.210
<i>and caused her a lot of trouble.</i>

00:12:11.280 --> 00:12:15.480
<i>Why don't you do something for 
yourself sometime, Kohane?</i>

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:16.130
Image updated to match Hizume's imagination

00:12:16.510 --> 00:12:19.630
And that's when I discovered cheer!

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:23.630
A wonderful sport where you can 
support people by cheering them on!

00:12:24.080 --> 00:12:27.570
You're the reason I want to 
start cheerleading, Arima-san!

00:12:27.570 --> 00:12:29.700
M-Me?

00:12:30.660 --> 00:12:33.140
You smiled like you were having so much fun!

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:36.150
Your dance moves and jumps 
were on point and amazing!

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:39.160
Most importantly, your posture was perfect!

00:12:38.090 --> 00:12:40.150
<i>Is she trying to compliment me to death?</i>

00:12:40.460 --> 00:12:45.340
So if there's some reason you can't 
do cheer even though you want to...

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:51.170
If there's something troubling 
you, I want to help you out.

00:13:02.160 --> 00:13:03.280
I—

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:06.180
Because to me, you're special, Arima-san!

00:13:11.870 --> 00:13:14.560
There's nothing troubling me...

00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:15.060
Arima-sa—

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:16.610
And I won't be cheerleading.

00:13:16.610 --> 00:13:20.450
And how do you plan on being 
a cheerleader who's scared of heights?

00:13:20.450 --> 00:13:21.210
Huh?

00:13:22.080 --> 00:13:24.220
I'm sure this is all some 
kind of game to you!

00:13:24.220 --> 00:13:27.320
That's an insult to me <i>and</i> to cheerleading!

00:13:28.380 --> 00:13:29.150
You...

00:13:30.300 --> 00:13:31.250
You...

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:33.740
Clueless goody-two-shoes!

00:13:36.530 --> 00:13:39.840
W-Was that an insult?

00:13:45.390 --> 00:13:46.590
I see...

00:13:46.790 --> 00:13:48.580
So you made her angry.

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:49.820
Yeah...

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:55.480
I just happened to talk to someone who went 
to middle school with Arima-san, but...

00:13:56.980 --> 00:13:58.600
Uki!

00:13:58.600 --> 00:14:00.730
I-It was just a coincidence!

00:14:01.930 --> 00:14:06.950
Arima-san was on her local cheerleading team

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:10.740
and kept getting better.

00:14:11.290 --> 00:14:15.370
But apparently the other girls 
on her team couldn't keep up.

00:14:16.690 --> 00:14:21.390
So Arima-san sort of stood out, 
then basically quit the team,

00:14:21.390 --> 00:14:24.630
but it was more like she was forced out.

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:28.550
Her teammates are so mean!

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:31.640
Okay!

00:14:32.130 --> 00:14:34.110
I'm going to start practicing immediately!

00:14:34.110 --> 00:14:36.140
Wait, how'd you come to that conclusion?!

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:43.080
<i>I'm sure she wasn't actually 
trying to mock me...</i>

00:14:45.120 --> 00:14:49.080
Because to me, you're special, Arima-san!

00:14:50.750 --> 00:14:53.880
<i>I got angry and took it out on her...</i>

00:14:54.750 --> 00:14:56.450
Clueless goody-two-shoes!

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:01.360
<i>I'm so embarrassed by how I acted...</i>

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:06.700
I hope she doesn't keep following 
me around tomorrow.

00:15:08.440 --> 00:15:09.380
Morning!

00:15:10.290 --> 00:15:12.890
<i>She seemed rather audacious</i>

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:14.440
<i>but I haven't seen her this morning.</i>

00:15:15.630 --> 00:15:18.390
<i>Maybe she finally realized 
how awkward this is...</i>

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:19.600
<i>Or not!</i>

00:15:21.780 --> 00:15:24.440
<i>What is she trying to do?</i>

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:28.560
<i>She wouldn't actually talk to 
me like nothing happened...</i>

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:38.410
<i>Am I being cursed?!</i>

00:15:39.430 --> 00:15:40.410
Welcome back!

00:15:40.700 --> 00:15:42.030
Where have you been?

00:15:42.030 --> 00:15:45.420
I went to see Arima-san! 
She seemed down yesterday

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:47.830
so... I was sending her these vibes...

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:49.820
No, cheers!

00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:51.430
You just yelled your correction.

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:53.320
Let's see this "cheer."

00:15:56.310 --> 00:15:58.270
<i>Maybe it's some kind of ritualistic dance...</i>

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:05.870
So what are you going to 
do for this training?

00:16:05.870 --> 00:16:09.880
For now, I wanna get used to being 
in high places, even a little bit.

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:11.700
High places...

00:16:12.520 --> 00:16:14.660
Like on some roof or Ferris wheels?

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:16.650
Or maybe bumpy jumping...

00:16:16.650 --> 00:16:18.200
Did you just censor yourself?

00:16:19.100 --> 00:16:21.210
Well, in your case...

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:23.620
Why don't we start here?

00:16:24.140 --> 00:16:25.630
Heave-ho!

00:16:26.470 --> 00:16:28.130
Quit taking levels off.

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:31.380
Okay, let's do this!

00:16:33.230 --> 00:16:35.210
Stand up! Come on, now!

00:16:35.210 --> 00:16:36.390
Okay, stop!

00:16:36.810 --> 00:16:38.260
I'm going to die!

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:44.160
<i>She's completely disappeared 
these past few days...</i>

00:16:44.160 --> 00:16:48.050
Hatoya-san picked up some money that 
I accidentally dropped into a gap.

00:16:48.050 --> 00:16:50.530
Oh, that girl that was trying
 to hype up the cheer club?

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:51.650
Yeah, her.

00:16:52.230 --> 00:16:54.660
There was a girl who helped us
 pick up all the garbage...

00:16:54.840 --> 00:16:57.660
Oh, yeah! She was a lifesaver.

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:01.660
<i>Even when I can't see her, 
I definitely feel her presence.</i>

00:17:03.440 --> 00:17:05.210
H-Hi!

00:17:06.210 --> 00:17:08.670
O-Oh, this is just...

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:11.220
I-I have a really bad 
habit of tapping my feet!

00:17:11.220 --> 00:17:13.170
Kohane, that's reaching!

00:17:14.620 --> 00:17:16.180
You should probably stop that.

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:17.630
She believed it?

00:17:23.010 --> 00:17:26.190
<i>Did those two start 
cheerleading on their own?</i>

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:30.800
<i>Even though she kept inviting me before...</i>

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:35.300
No! What did I just say?!

00:17:37.960 --> 00:17:42.200
I took my anger out on her,
 so what can I expect?

00:17:46.470 --> 00:17:47.630
You can do it!

00:17:47.630 --> 00:17:49.460
Go!

00:17:50.690 --> 00:17:52.210
Arima-san,

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:55.840
you might think you're special because 
you're super talented or whatever,

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:58.220
but we're all equal here.

00:17:58.630 --> 00:18:01.800
You need to come down to our level.

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:05.230
I decline.

00:18:05.720 --> 00:18:08.210
Fine, then do whatever you 
want on your own.

00:18:14.510 --> 00:18:19.440
<i>In the end, whether I do cheer or not...</i>

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:24.180
<i>I end up alone.</i>

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:32.880
Hooray, hooray, Hizume!

00:18:33.220 --> 00:18:37.390
You can do it, you can do it, Hizume!

00:18:39.290 --> 00:18:42.710
I'm not going anywhere, Arima-san!

00:18:43.550 --> 00:18:46.890
No matter what, I'll follow you!

00:18:47.530 --> 00:18:50.690
So let's do cheer together!

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:55.400
Although I might be a tiny bit 
scared of heights... or something.

00:18:55.810 --> 00:18:57.940
Let's do our best together!

00:18:58.920 --> 00:19:02.280
<i>I'm so nervous for her, I can't even 
understand what's going on right now!</i>

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:04.500
If you're special, Arima-san...

00:19:06.640 --> 00:19:09.920
I'll do my best to become special, too!

00:19:24.670 --> 00:19:27.760
I'll work really hard, too!

00:19:29.970 --> 00:19:32.360
S-Stunts!

00:19:32.970 --> 00:19:35.320
<i>Stunts? She thinks that jump is
a cheerleading move?!</i>

00:19:46.210 --> 00:19:48.110
S-So...

00:19:49.110 --> 00:19:51.330
How was my first cheer...

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:53.330
You idiot!

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:55.780
Why would you close your eyes, <i>then</i> jump?!

00:19:55.780 --> 00:19:58.820
Not to mention that was the 
wrong kind of cheerleading!

00:19:58.820 --> 00:20:01.090
What on earth are you trying to do?!

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:04.970
You call that cheerleading?! All you 
did was yell and jump out of a tree!

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:09.420
She's done me in with her overly 
ruthless, piercing words...

00:20:10.330 --> 00:20:13.490
But you caught me, Arima-san.

00:20:15.210 --> 00:20:17.950
I'm pretty sure that you can
 only start cheerleading

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:19.820
once you trust those around you.

00:20:21.890 --> 00:20:25.220
I was able to jump because
 I believe in you, Arima-san.

00:20:30.360 --> 00:20:31.370
So now...

00:20:32.070 --> 00:20:33.790
Believe in me, Arima-san.

00:20:37.420 --> 00:20:38.880
Please don't underestimate me.

00:20:39.310 --> 00:20:42.570
She totally just kicked 
me when I was down...

00:20:42.570 --> 00:20:46.390
They considered my support 
as the impregnable base.

00:20:47.190 --> 00:20:50.640
Supporting you will be a breeze.

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:56.340
Arima-san!

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:03.790
Hey, what happened to the impregnable base?

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:07.010
There are no stunts where you tackle 
your teammate from the side!

00:21:09.300 --> 00:21:11.410
I need you to teach me stuff like that, too.

00:21:12.120 --> 00:21:14.420
I look forward to working with you!

00:21:16.300 --> 00:21:16.950
Me, too.

00:21:21.920 --> 00:21:23.920
Since you said you'd follow me,

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:28.520
I'm going to make sure you learn 
everything. Yes, <i>everything</i>.

00:21:28.960 --> 00:21:30.930
I have a feeling this is 
gonna get hardcore...

00:21:31.190 --> 00:21:35.270
Okay! We just need three more 
people to start the cheer club!

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:36.800
Yay!

00:21:36.800 --> 00:21:38.460
Don't you mean just two?

00:21:37.380 --> 00:21:39.410
We did it!

00:21:38.460 --> 00:21:42.100
What about Uki-san? She looked quite sensible.

00:21:42.100 --> 00:21:44.950
Huh? Uki is uh...

00:21:45.210 --> 00:21:48.420
She's definitely a candidate... and 
I'm uh, trying to get her to join?

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:51.400
I may have to reconsider my offer.

00:21:52.320 --> 00:21:55.080
Arima-san!

00:22:06.090 --> 00:22:09.990
<b>Anima Yell!</b>

00:23:27.530 --> 00:23:30.430
<i>I did it, Uki! Arima-san said 
she'd do cheer with me!</i>

00:23:30.430 --> 00:23:31.400
<i>Good for you!</i>

00:23:31.400 --> 00:23:32.490
<i>You should join, too, Uki!</i>

00:23:32.490 --> 00:23:33.800
<i>I already told you I won't.</i>

00:23:34.080 --> 00:23:37.790
<i>Next time on episode 2 of 
</i>Anima Yell<i>: "Cute Yet Cool".</i>

00:23:37.790 --> 00:23:39.940
<i>Come on, everyone! Go, foh, whoa!</i>

00:23:39.940 --> 00:23:41.230
Whoa, what?
